# Azure-ADF-Blob-to-SQL-Pipeline
Azure Data Factory pipeline to ingest CSV data from Azure Blob Storage and load into Azure SQL Database using Linked Services and Copy Activity.

**Create Linked Service to connect to Azure SQLDB**
1.Login to the Azure Data Factory
2.Go to Manage and click on +New, Select Azure
3.Select Azure SQL Databases
4.Assign name to Linked Service
5. Provide the necessary details:
•	Name: AzureSQLClinicalResearchDB_LS
•	Connect via integration runtime: AutoResolveIntegrationRuntime
•	Server name: clinicalresearchsqlserver
•	Database name: ClinicalResearchDB
•	Authentication method: Choose SQL Authentication 
•	Username/Password: If using SQL Authentication, enter the SQL Server credentials.
•	You need to Test Connection
6. Test connection to ensure that Data Factory can connect to the Azure SQL Database.
7. Create the linked service.

