**Create Linked Service to connect to Blob Storage**
1. Login to the Azure Data Factory
2.Go to Manage and click on +New, Select Azure
3.Select Blob Storage
4. Provide the necessary details:
Name: ClinicalResearchSA_LS
 Description: Linked Service for connecting to Azure Blob Storage
Connect via integration runtime: AutoResolveIntegrationRuntime
Authentication method: Account key
Subscription: Enter Manually
 Storage account name: clinicalresearchsas
5. Test connection to ensure that Data Factory can connect to the Blob Storage account successfully.
6.Create the linked service.

